@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Abrir Sesión de Clase (Profesor / Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/sessions
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionId": "SECTION_UUID_HERE"
}

### Registrar Asistencia con Secreto QR (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/record
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "SESSION_UUID_HERE",
  "secret": "A1B2C3D4"
}

### Cerrar Sesión de Clase y Computar Faltas (Profesor / Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/sessions/SESSION_UUID_HERE/close
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Corrección Manual de Asistencia (Profesor / Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/attendance/records/RECORD_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "EXCUSED",
  "reason": "Justificante médico presentado"
}

### Consultar Historial de Asistencia del Alumno
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/my-attendance
Authorization: {{authToken}}

